title: The opened folder is app/ of a larger repository: a commit that touched files inside and outside shows only the ones inside, one that touched nothing inside says so, the first commit shows the folder's files; off gives the working text back
folders: git-subfolder-history/app
forbid-log: script: ignoring
forbid-log: commit needs off

wait 3000
left changes
wait 500
mark 0-before
wait 500
commit 0
wait 1800
mark 1-inside-and-outside
wait 500
commit 1
wait 1800
mark 2-only-outside
wait 500
commit 2
wait 1800
mark 3-first
wait 500
commit off
wait 1800
mark 4-off
wait 500
quit
